Package: com.legacyreborn.legacysurf
Name: Legacy Surf
Version: @VERSION@
X-Surf-Base-Version: @SURF_BASE_VERSION@
X-Surf-Compatibility: @COMPATIBILITY_VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Surf, legacified: the Surf remote browser with a skeuomorphic iOS 6 look. Websites run in Chromium on your computer (Surf server @SURF_BASE_VERSION@) and stream to the device. On iOS 6 the app wears classic Safari chrome; iOS 7 and later keep the original flat design.
Maintainer: LegacyReborn Project
Author: LegacyReborn Project (fork of Surf by seg6)
Section: Networking
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0)
Tag: role::enduser, purpose::uikit
